{
  "_id": "wp-post-2143",
  "_type": "post",
  "_createdAt": "2026-02-10T06:44:39Z",
  "_updatedAt": "2026-10-08T08:22:09Z",
  "title": "Big Changes to UK Student Visa Rules – What You Need to Know",
  "slug": {
    "_type": "slug",
    "current": "big-changes-to-uk-student-visa-rules-what-you-need-to-know"
  },
  "publishedAt": "2025-04-08T04:01:21",
  "excerpt": "The UK Home Office has announced important updates to student visa regulations that will impact international students heading to the [&hellip;]",
  "content": [
    {
      "_key": "ca36fe30b5fa",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "b8a4661ec603",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The UK Home Office has announced important updates to student visa regulations that will impact international students heading to the UK. These changes, introduced on "
        },
        {
          "_key": "31cb0e57d512",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "March 12, 2025"
        },
        {
          "_key": "1ac40813c866",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", will roll out in stages starting "
        },
        {
          "_key": "2fa54c397dde",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "April 2025"
        },
        {
          "_key": "f86dbd575682",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ". Here’s a simplified breakdown to help you stay informed and prepared."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "fed71baa6bb1",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "981d35a25f76",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "1. Smoother Transfers for PhD Students"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "b1c3470862f5",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "4ef68eb428b4",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Effective from April 9, 2025"
        },
        {
          "_key": "9c21b18573d6",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", PhD students needing to switch universities to continue working with their academic supervisor will "
        },
        {
          "_key": "f48b4f2cc9e3",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "no longer need to demonstrate academic progress"
        },
        {
          "_key": "ec325dd3c959",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " when applying for a new student visa."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "bbf15a9b3502",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "506962441c55",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "👉 This is a big win for doctoral students, making academic mobility more flexible and reducing administrative barriers during your research journey."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "79db995a79dc",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "7873c04de4b6",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "2. Changes for Medical and Dental Postgraduates"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "47185e706b35",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "b99970c4005f",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "If you’re planning to complete a "
        },
        {
          "_key": "d7677f105d34",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "foundation program in medicine or dentistry"
        },
        {
          "_key": "13c015638b86",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " in the UK, there are some major changes to be aware of:"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "be9d4aab74fc",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "d8d7e99b69d1",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "From April 9, 2025"
        },
        {
          "_key": "7fbb01063aad",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", Health Education England (HEE) will no longer act as a licensed student visa sponsor."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "6eed67019f9c",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "d533937b4efe",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "As a result:\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "741de3a838f0",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "21ee15632877",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "1e8e24eb8a7a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The term "
        },
        {
          "_key": "0a8eeff6816a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "em"
          ],
          "text": "‘Postgraduate doctor or dentist’"
        },
        {
          "_key": "004d73561fd4",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " will be removed from immigration rules."
        }
      ],
      "level": 2,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "ce36726be876",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "0fbfdac95abf",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "You will "
        },
        {
          "_key": "511da217407d",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "not"
        },
        {
          "_key": "266aafdd25e7",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " be able to apply for a student visa for foundation programs in these fields."
        }
      ],
      "level": 2,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "23fadc32dd22",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "fe0f31b0a8ad",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "These programs will "
        },
        {
          "_key": "ac04628bc0d6",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "no longer qualify"
        },
        {
          "_key": "cf1348a7bcaa",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " for the "
        },
        {
          "_key": "983497a5c49d",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Graduate Route"
        },
        {
          "_key": "62b69ba73a6a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " (post-study work visa)."
        }
      ],
      "level": 2,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "8e45d756077c",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "8fca24c7392f",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "🎓 If you wish to remain in the UK for work after your program, you’ll now need to apply through the "
        },
        {
          "_key": "c330878c9e33",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Skilled Worker visa"
        },
        {
          "_key": "a162275280f5",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " route."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "e9f3a9b34c64",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "193219a3b5e2",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "3. New Way to Fix Visa Errors"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "057378116008",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "5e0fbc21ae75",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Previously, you could request an administrative review if there was an error in your visa conditions or duration. Starting "
        },
        {
          "_key": "6363ba8b431a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "April 9, 2025"
        },
        {
          "_key": "a2125abc0306",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", this process changes:"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "2638cf86603e",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "d370a61195a2",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The UK Home Office will handle such corrections through a newly expanded "
        },
        {
          "_key": "8ddf2c433056",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Error Correction team"
        },
        {
          "_key": "c410905a2d5f",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "2f44dcbc28e9",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "2614abf11375",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "This applies to visa applications made "
        },
        {
          "_key": "0eaa7d4b41d2",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "within the UK"
        },
        {
          "_key": "27434d1655ce",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "443c815f4ee4",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "5a4f2bfb4c43",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Administrative reviews will no longer be an option"
        },
        {
          "_key": "a005ecef1295",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " for correcting these types of issues."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "c700d12fcf59",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "630565e98c8f",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "⚠️ Be sure to double-check your visa details upon receipt and report any issues promptly."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "8fe59815e86c",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "0e6167e3e33a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "What Does This Mean for You?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "8e0786acab73",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "a14528f27992",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Whether you’re a "
        },
        {
          "_key": "ae7d0c44f082",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "PhD student"
        },
        {
          "_key": "0c7b26e49a8e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", a "
        },
        {
          "_key": "58012c3ac78e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "medical graduate"
        },
        {
          "_key": "d4b623f98f58",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", or applying for a "
        },
        {
          "_key": "f9e0d092cffc",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "visa correction"
        },
        {
          "_key": "e381e4d79e6d",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", these updates could directly affect your plans. Staying informed is key."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "2ba5ad3b0e10",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "5abd89a0ed25",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Need Help?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "648d6dfdb1fc",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "e3a18b569fe6",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "At "
        },
        {
          "_key": "61aafaf9ed5d",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Admizz Education"
        },
        {
          "_key": "0c5d81e3aa0a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", we guide international students every step of the way—from choosing the right course to navigating student visas. If you’re planning to study in the UK, we’re here to help you understand how these changes might impact your journey."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
